Setup needed before the gated calls:
1) Email verification is required to enroll and review. Use the token from the emailed link (`<frontend-url>/verify-email?token=...`) in 'Verify email', or for a local demo set it directly in the DB:
UPDATE users SET email_verified = TRUE WHERE email = 'your@email';
2) Admin endpoints need the ADMIN role. Promote a user once with SQL, then log in again:
UPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@example.com';

Paste the `token` query parameter from the verification link into the collection variable `verificationToken`. If it is empty this request is skipped, so the runner keeps going; enroll then returns 403 until the account is verified (or use the SQL above).

